  characterName: "Chinwe Okoro \u25CF \u25CB"
  promptText: Dear Leaf, Dead Dinossaus's pipeline leaked into our river again, the
    third spill this year. Their money keeps our school running. Do I report it?
  leftAnswer: Report it. A clean river outlasts any grant
  rightAnswer: Stay quiet for now. The school needs the money
